# Root cleanliness - Amendment 014/017: Seven-file MD whitelist
/*.md
!README.md
!CODEBASE_MAP.md
!SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md
!PROJECT_CHARTER.md
!DAILY_CONTEXT.md
!IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md
!NRW_DATA_WORKFLOW_EXPLAINED.md

# Block root .txt files except requirements and youtube token
/*.txt
!requirements.txt
!youtube_token_base64.txt

# Block backup scripts and debug files in root
/*.backup
/*.backup-*
/*.bak
